<title>AUSTRALIA: MIM changes copper price - May 20.</title>
<headline>MIM changes copper price - May 20.</headline>
<text>
<p>BRISBANE, 20 AAP - Mount Isa Mines Ltd said it will raise prices by $50 to 3,350 dollars per tonne for cathodes and raise prices by $50 to 3,362 dollars per tonne for standard rods effective May 21.</p>
</text>
